{% comment %}
  Product page presentation fixes.

  Replaces the earlier pdp-mobile-fold section and now carries two changes:

  1. Mobile above-the-fold. Measured on the Purple Bearbrick page at 375x812
     before the fix: .tdp-thumbs wrapped 12 thumbnails onto 3 rows (178px),
     gallery total 528px, price at y=874 - below the fold. Collapsing the
     strip to one scrollable row and capping the hero image reclaims ~165px
     and lifts the price above the fold.

  2. Specs panel open by default. .tdp-hspec ships collapsed, with an inline
     onclick that toggles the 'open' class. Dimensions, material and finish
     were therefore invisible unless a shopper tapped the header - the first
     thing someone needs to know about a 70cm figure. Adding the class on
     load opens it while leaving the toggle intact, so it can still be
     collapsed.

  Both belong in sections/diorama-product.liquid alongside the rest of the
  product CSS; they live here only to avoid rewriting that 74KB file
  wholesale. Fold them in next time that file is edited.
{% endcomment %}

{%- if template.name == 'product' and product != blank -%}
  <style>
    @media (max-width: 749px) {
      .tdp-gallery .tdp-thumbs {
        flex-wrap: nowrap;
        overflow-x: auto;
        overflow-y: hidden;
        scrollbar-width: none;
        -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      }
      .tdp-gallery .tdp-thumbs::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
      .tdp-gallery .tdp-thumb { flex: 0 0 auto; }

      .tdp-gallery .tdp-main-img { max-height: 300px; }
      .tdp-gallery .tdp-main-img img {
        max-height: 300px;
        object-fit: contain;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <script>
    (function () {
      function openSpecs() {
        var panels = document.querySelectorAll('.tdp-hspec');
        for (var i = 0; i < panels.length; i++) {
          panels[i].classList.add('open');
        }
      }
      openSpecs();
      // Re-apply when the theme editor re-renders the product section.
      document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', openSpecs);
    })();
  </script>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "PDP presentation fixes",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
